# Bench-test logs. A working area, not an archive: `git clean -xdf` wipes this along with the
# build dirs. Anything that is evidence for a bug belongs attached to its GitHub issue.
bench-logs/

# Build artifacts. One glob, not a line per tree: the four names listed here one by one let a
# fifth (build-preview/, 86 MB) sit untracked in `git status` for days. Nothing tracked in the
# repo starts with "build", so name a throwaway tree build-<purpose>/ and it is covered.
/build*/
*.o
*.d
*.a
*.so
*.dylib

